                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Spined Fingertips",
                  "marks": ["strong"]
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " Your fingers sprout microscopic metal spines that enable you to cling to surfaces like a spider. You gain a climb Speed of 20 feet."
